# The frontend's build inputs and outputs. `node_modules` is ~400 MB of host-platform binaries and
# would be COPIED OVER the image's own `npm ci` result; `app-dist` is a stale local build that
# would shadow the one the frontend stage produces. Both must come from the build, not the host.
